      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/uk-news/2026/sep/27/villagers-raf-fairford-evacuation",
      "description": "<p>Local people say members of WhatsApp group noticed suspicious activity around vans in Whelford overnight</p><p>Those living near RAF Fairford have been used to disturbance from protesters and a heavy police presence after the decision to allow the US air force to use it as a base for attacks on Iran.</p><p>But in recent weeks, people have noticed dramatically increased security measures, with the gates of the base newly barricaded.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/uk-news/2026/sep/27/villagers-raf-fairford-evacuation\">Continue reading...</a>",
